      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193360_797450_24431" xmi:uuid="aac02ade-c182-4b11-b47a-1011bebd7f36" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454492057142_602133_42931" xmi:uuid="f85dd5b1-fd30-4ed8-ab09-50210e6bf488" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193360_797450_24431"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'decomposition': The Related object is one of potentially more components of the Relating AlternativeSolution. This relation type shall only be used for Relating and Related objects of the same type;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'functionality': The Related object is an element of the functional structure of the Relating object;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;example&gt;The AlternativeSolution 'heat dissipation' may be considered as one of the functionalities to be fulfilled by any TechnicalSolution. for the BreakdownElement; the 'braking system'.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;li&gt;'realization': The Related AlternativeSolution is a means for fulfilling, either partially or fully, the requirements identified by the Relating AlternativeSolution. This relation type shall only be used for Relating and Related objects of different types; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'specialization': The Related object fulfils the requirements of the Relating AlternativeSolution in a more specific way than defined for the Relating AlternativeSolution. This relation type shall only be used for Relating and Related objects of the same type.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193359_398449_24424"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193360_501263_24432" xmi:uuid="fb658b8e-7952-42c3-9cd5-2f5d6dc0a994" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454492112133_619715_42932" xmi:uuid="2f585412-324f-4d93-9273-38d6f21e4b22" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193360_501263_24432"/>
          <body> the first of the two AlternativeSolution objects related by the AlternativeSolutionRelationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Relating</name>
