        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193261_775181_23868"/>
        <body>A SupplierSolution is a type of AlternativeSolution that is an alternative solution provided by a specific supplier. &lt;example&gt;The BreakdownElement 'tyre' has a TechnicalSolution of '225x50 VR17' with suppliers A, B, or C. A SupplierSolution is associated with each of these suppliers.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>SupplierSolution</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193457_963301_25217" xmi:uuid="363aba64-c9f3-4ee2-8e2f-19e779447504" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
