      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551115837924_592848_101238" xmi:uuid="12fa443d-ffe8-4185-a69e-207ad7795257" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_290014c_1550847743191_208266_98071"/>
        <body>These flowports are not bound to the ARM target because only a product definition property type can be assigned to it.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454493416897_585235_42983" xmi:uuid="5ce59a81-7068-4471-aea0-6abcfb9cdab0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193029_140190_23425"/>
        <body>A BreakdownElementVersionRelationship is an association between two BreakdownElementVersion objects. &lt;note&gt; Such a relationship may exist between two BreakdownElementVersion objects of the same BreakdownElement object or of different BreakdownElement objects.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>BreakdownElementVersionRelationship</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325951507_336988_42488" xmi:uuid="60caf533-c9e1-4871-81a4-26287294b200" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325987691_621238_42490" xmi:uuid="7eaa67ac-31c2-4df3-a504-0b6cda31c0ad" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325951507_336988_42488"/>
          <body>the related BreakdownElementVersion and the relating BreakdownElementVersion shall be different.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121899_102375_163170" xmi:uuid="9e17ced0-04b1-478c-9573-ffdb5da11137" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
