      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193425_551153_24991" xmi:uuid="ed6bc795-d536-4c9a-b06c-cb14a6d5f89e" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454493693754_167569_42987" xmi:uuid="b1dc300c-9498-4319-9a20-814347496fb2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193425_551153_24991"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following class names shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'derivation': the object defines a deriving relationship where the Related BreakdownElementVersion is based on the Relating BreakdownElementVersion, which is an earlier version of the same or of a different BreakdownElement; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'hierarchy': the object defines a hierarchical relationship where the Related BreakdownElementVersion is a subordinate version of the Relating BreakdownElementVersion; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;example&gt; 'Rev. 1.1' and 'rev. 1.2' are subordinates of 'version 1'. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': the object defines a version sequence where the Relating BreakdownElementVersion is the preceding version of the Related BreakdownElementVersion that is the following version. For a given BreakdownElementVersion object, there shall be at most one BreakdownElementVersionRelationship object of this RelationType referring to this BreakdownElementVersion object as Relating and at most one other BreakdownElementVersionRelationship object of this RelationType referring the same BreakdownElementVersion, object as Related.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
