        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193029_414916_23424"/>
        <body>A BreakdownElementVersion is a revision of a BreakdownElement. It is a collector of the views of this revision of the BreakdownElement. &lt;note&gt; The set of all instances of BreakdownElementVersion of the same BreakdownElement represents the history of the BreakdownElement.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526316068012_759365_96483" xmi:uuid="4ed67e18-45a7-4be6-abb0-0591e543a57a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Breakdown_element_version-of_product"/>
        <body>BreakdownElement.Versions provides the mapping of Breakdown_element_version.of_product </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>BreakdownElementVersion</name>
