    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193134_143137_23627" xmi:uuid="800ba148-7f8c-4d97-9123-284bfe6bd8ac" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454495850160_543984_43075" xmi:uuid="55b7ce5e-b027-4805-a387-1b432c7e0b0f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193134_143137_23627"/>
        <body>An InZone is an association between a BreakdownElementView that represents a zone and an item that exists within this zone and that is of one of the following types: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;ActivityMethod, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ActivityMethodAssignment, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BreakdownElementView, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;DocumentDefinition, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;IndividualPartView, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PartView or &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;RequirementView.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>InZone</name>
