        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193107_898311_23585"/>
        <body>A FunctionalBreakdownElementViewAssociation is a relationship between an item that represents a function and an item that represents the physical incarnation of this function. The physical counterpart may be represented as an AlternativeSolution, BreakdownElement or PartView.</body>
