        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193266_161944_23874"/>
        <body>A TechnicalSolution is a type of AlternativeSolution that is an alternative solution where the functional requirements are fulfilled in a certain technical way. &lt;example&gt;'disc brake', 'disc brake ventilated' and 'disc brake with ABS' are examples of TechnicalSolution objects for BreakdownElement 'front left brake'.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
