    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193106_847156_23581" xmi:uuid="b76a6570-b65c-47e3-b79b-b1cf5e1c5f5f" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454495331887_138714_43065" xmi:uuid="68fb8f48-5b6a-43db-a34e-2e583986858d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193106_847156_23581"/>
        <body>A FinalSolution is a type of AlternativeSolution and is a set of additional sensual characteristics that can be applied to an Occurrence that represents a neutral part in order to complete its definition. &lt;example&gt; In the case of a car body, the neutral parts are parts without paint; the final parts are the parts with paint. In the case of a seat, the neutral part is the seat with unspecified cover material; the final part may be the seat covered with red leather. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;note&gt; A FinalSolution may be associated with an Occurrence that represents the finalized part through a BreakdownElementRealization. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The information common to all final solutions based on the same neutral part may identified by use of instances of MakeFromRelationship.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>FinalSolution</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513960121143_932485_91631" xmi:uuid="5959aad8-0f3c-4ffb-96a1-c4cdcb6824f9" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513076037039_374921_42164"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193355_170099_24389" xmi:uuid="a6164283-bd93-4a38-8784-4d82f6d81653" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193016_806262_23388"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513960117383_592994_91628" xmi:uuid="ddda50bb-00f0-4472-bee4-181d0def0437" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513076037040_166958_42165"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_595816_26982" xmi:uuid="1dcc1bd8-d730-492e-8893-ed550331d148" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454495374137_574726_43066" xmi:uuid="196ccec6-3346-446f-a95a-e2ee8440db0c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_595816_26982"/>
          <body> the set of means of finalization that are applied to the neutral part and which may be objects of type IndividualPartView, PartView or RequirementView. &lt;example&gt; The specifications may be the PartView objects of a certain kind of paint. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;note&gt; The PartView that is referenced here, is not a view of the Part that results from the finalization. The Part that results from the finalization, such as, a Part with colour, is identified by an association between FinalSolution and Occurrence through a BreakdownElementRealization.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Specifications</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193106_108689_23580"/>
        <upperValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194498_308843_32184" xmi:uuid="433be946-9d34-468a-beec-56b0967d0b6c" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
          <value>*</value>
        </upperValue>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193697_696289_26978"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_542236_26983" xmi:uuid="3b990257-b999-4f4e-b2d2-e527a5486419" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454495407847_750290_43067" xmi:uuid="b2251d1f-3325-44ce-b6a9-f324ec617e8f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_542236_26983"/>
          <body> the text string that describes the level of completion between the neutral part and the final part. &lt;example&gt; 'final for shipping overseas', 'final for transport by truck', or 'final for sale' are examples for status.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Status</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193509_757222_25530"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
