        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193027_26354_23419"/>
        <body>A BreakdownElement is a constituent in one or more Breakdown objects. In such structure a BreakdownElement may play the role of a parent or a child or both. &lt;note&gt; The type of BreakdownElement is specified by ClassifiedAs; there are no sub-classes of BreakdownElement. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; A BreakdownElement may be referenced from several Breakdown objects.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
