        <annotatedElement href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_290014c_1550847743191_208266_98071"/>
        <body>These flowports are not bound to the ARM target because only a product definition property type can be assigned to it.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454494325867_953989_43027" xmi:uuid="5040a5c6-8b6c-4006-b0b1-9422b45c1497" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193032_328359_23429"/>
        <body>A BreakdownVersion is a revision of a Breakdown. &lt;note&gt; The set of all instances of BreakdownVersion of the same Breakdown represents the history of the Breakdown.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526315391065_588864_95400" xmi:uuid="635bcb4a-e22a-4342-9352-663b2b83e06c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Breakdown_version-of_product"/>
        <body>Breakdown.Versions provides the mapping of Breakdown_version.of_product </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526315605750_70980_95607" xmi:uuid="b95c4bf3-8438-40bb-aa2c-45a3734355b1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Breakdown_version-breakdown_of"/>
        <body>Inverse attributes do not need to be mapped</body>
      </ownedComment>
