      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193420_473364_24946" xmi:uuid="0b2c2484-b68b-40b9-aa81-91114743eede" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454493054187_921199_42973" xmi:uuid="90069329-e53c-4e45-a14c-bf6355824fbd" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193420_473364_24946"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following class names shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'hierarchy': the object defines a hierarchical relationship where the Related BreakdownElement is a subordinate element of the Relating BreakdownElement; &lt;note&gt; This value is used for sparent-child relationships. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': the object defines a sequence of elements where the Relating BreakdownElement is the preceding element of the Related BreakdownElement that is the following element. For a given BreakdownElement object, there shall be at most one BreakdownElementRelationship object of this RelationType referring to this BreakdownElement object as Relating and at most one other BreakdownElementRelationship object of this RelationType referring the same BreakdownElement, object as Related.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
