      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193446_756810_25130" xmi:uuid="7aed1460-8074-49a6-a86f-079931662d2c" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454494737730_402755_43051" xmi:uuid="20ad52bb-ffab-41c3-abdf-e2d95d163396" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193446_756810_25130"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following class names shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'derivation': the object defines a deriving relationship where the Related BreakdownVersion is based on the Relating BreakdownVersion, which is an earlier version of the same or of a different Breakdown; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'hierarchy': the object defines a hierarchical relationship where the Related BreakdownVersion is a subordinate version of the Relating BreakdownVersion; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;example&gt; 'Rev. 1.1' and 'rev. 1.2' are subordinates of 'version 1'. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': the object defines a version sequence where the Relating BreakdownVersion is the preceding version of the Related BreakdownVersion that is the following version. For a given BreakdownVersion object, there shall be at most one BreakdownVersionRelationship object of this RelationType referring to this BreakdownVersion object as Relating and at most one other BreakdownVersionRelationship object of this RelationType referring the same BreakdownVersion, object as Related.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193445_871154_25122"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
